<p>Your fury becomes an unseen force that randomly lashes out at foes around you. For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns you strike <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 66%, 99%, 26%, 50%</acronym> chance for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym>) nearby target(s) within range 5 doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">83, 112, 134, 153, 170</acronym> damage and 2 knockback. The number of extra strikes increases at higher talent levels.</p><p>In addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 15%</acronym> (currently: 0%)</p><p>Damage increases with your Mindpower.</p>